      "cooked": "<p><strong>Issue with GST Tax Template Auto-Selection in Purchase Invoice Based on Supplier in ERPNext v15</strong></p>\n<p>I am facing an issue in ERPNext v15 while creating a Purchase Invoice with India GST compliance enabled. The setup involves:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Two suppliers (Supplier A and Supplier B)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>One item “Oil” which is taxable and has an assigned 5% GST Item Tax Template</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a name=\"p-484831-problem-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484831-problem-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Problem:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>When I select Supplier A and add the “Oil” item in the Purchase Invoice, <strong>the GST is NOT calculated automatically</strong>.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/c/ac09c3d1d80fbdec9309849ce01d53a90ea5d923.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ac09c3d1d80fbdec9309849ce01d53a90ea5d923\" title=\"10\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac09c3d1d80fbdec9309849ce01d53a90ea5d923_2_690x295.jpeg\" alt=\"10\" data-base62-sha1=\"oxV2Rs1DxiBeeprsP9btPH5dHI7\" width=\"690\" height=\"295\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac09c3d1d80fbdec9309849ce01d53a90ea5d923_2_690x295.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/c/ac09c3d1d80fbdec9309849ce01d53a90ea5d923_2_1035x442.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/c/ac09c3d1d80fbdec9309849ce01d53a90ea5d923.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAFA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">10</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×548 32.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>On the item line in the invoice, the “Item Tax Template” field remains empty (not auto-selected) and the “GST Treatment” is blank.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/2/4298f2b34c2ac148e0448b839df0a84fc62e7195.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4298f2b34c2ac148e0448b839df0a84fc62e7195\" title=\"20\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/4298f2b34c2ac148e0448b839df0a84fc62e7195_2_690x337.jpeg\" alt=\"20\" data-base62-sha1=\"9v9cziHF0FDfTjQqzRZtAVAsWZD\" width=\"690\" height=\"337\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/4298f2b34c2ac148e0448b839df0a84fc62e7195_2_690x337.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/2/4298f2b34c2ac148e0448b839df0a84fc62e7195_2_1035x505.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/2/4298f2b34c2ac148e0448b839df0a84fc62e7195.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×626 27.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When I select Supplier B and add the same “Oil” item, the system <strong>automatically picks the 5% Item Tax Template</strong> and sets the “GST Treatment” to “Taxable”.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/6/465f8f641ae85e805e96ac24a528e80b7e676778.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/465f8f641ae85e805e96ac24a528e80b7e676778\" title=\"30\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/465f8f641ae85e805e96ac24a528e80b7e676778_2_690x314.jpeg\" alt=\"30\" data-base62-sha1=\"a2y9TivbGStdQelyjS3FI5iUNeg\" width=\"690\" height=\"314\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/465f8f641ae85e805e96ac24a528e80b7e676778_2_690x314.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/465f8f641ae85e805e96ac24a528e80b7e676778_2_1035x471.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/6/465f8f641ae85e805e96ac24a528e80b7e676778.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">30</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×584 24.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I have cross checked it multiple times and the suppliers are the same in every aspect and there is no inconsistency for the same.</p>\n<p>Please help.</p>",
